flowchart TB
  classDef live fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#9a6700,color:#3d2d00
  classDef replay fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
  classDef offline fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#052e16
  classDef video fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#4b5563,color:#111827

  Live["LIVE MODEL<br/>optional cloud inference + live deterministic stack"]:::live
  Canonical["CANONICAL REPLAY<br/>default conference mode<br/>frozen probabilistic outputs + live deterministic stages when available"]:::replay
  Offline["OFFLINE REPLAY<br/>local static package<br/>no API, LLM, Neo4j, keys, or internet"]:::offline
  Video["BACKUP VIDEO<br/>5–6 minute full + 60–90 second emergency"]:::video

  Live -->|"model / API / graph failure"| Canonical
  Canonical -->|"network / hosting failure"| Offline
  Offline -->|"device / browser / unexpected failure"| Video
  Canonical -->|"Reset Demo"| Canonical
  Offline -->|"Reset Demo"| Offline
